5. Procedure  Insert Update Delete

Question:
Perform insert update delete using one procedure.

Code:

SQL> CREATE OR REPLACE PROCEDURE manage_student(
  2      p_id NUMBER,
  3      p_name VARCHAR2,
  4      p_gpa NUMBER,
  5      p_action VARCHAR2
  6  )
  7  IS
  8  BEGIN
  9      IF p_action = 'INSERT' THEN
 10          INSERT INTO STUDENT VALUES(p_id, p_name, p_gpa);
 11      ELSIF p_action = 'UPDATE' THEN
 12          UPDATE STUDENT
 13          SET NAME = p_name, GPA = p_gpa
 14          WHERE STUDENTID = p_id;
 15      ELSIF p_action = 'DELETE' THEN
 16          DELETE FROM STUDENT
 17          WHERE STUDENTID = p_id;
 18      END IF;
 19      COMMIT;
 20  END;
 21  /

